  "a sheet sliding half out of the front slot with an outward arrow.",
  "a sheet laid face down on the glass under the raised lid (inscannen); a sheet being written on with a pen (invullen); a cable pulled from a laptop (loskoppelen); a parcel handed over a counter (opsturen).",
